{"id":"f91503f4398fd2f3","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-surgery.md","title":"Surgery","display":"df-surgery — Surgery","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-surgery","aliases":["58-df-surgery"],"display":"df-surgery — Surgery","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-surgery"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-surgery</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-surgery — Surgery"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,X&#39;,e,k,n\\in V\">\\(X,X&#39;,e,k,n\\in V\\)</span> (source manifold, result, attaching map, index, and dimension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S\\)</span> are predicates from dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Surgery}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{Surgery}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surgery\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S(X,X&#39;,e,k,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(X)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land1\\leq k\\leq n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k+1},X)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k+1},X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land X&#39;\\cong\\operatorname{cl}\\!\\left(X\\setminus e``(S^{k-1}\\times\\operatorname{int}D^{n-k+1})\\right)\\mathop{\\cup}_{e\\upharpoonright(S^{k-1}\\times S^{n-k})}(D^k\\times S^{n-k}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surgery\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S(X,X&#39;,e,k,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(X)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land1\\leq k\\leq n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k+1},X)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k+1},X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land X&#39;\\cong\\operatorname{cl}\\!\\left(X\\setminus e``(S^{k-1}\\times\\operatorname{int}D^{n-k+1})\\right)\\mathop{\\cup}_{e\\upharpoonright(S^{k-1}\\times S^{n-k})}(D^k\\times S^{n-k}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surgery} \\vdash \\operatorname{Surgery}_S(X,X&#39;,e,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S(X,X&#39;,e,k,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surgery} \\vdash \\operatorname{Surgery}_S(X,X&#39;,e,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S(X,X&#39;,e,k,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Surgery removes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{k-1}\\times\\operatorname{int}D^{n-k+1}\">\\(S^{k-1}\\times\\operatorname{int}D^{n-k+1}\\)</span> and glues in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^k\\times S^{n-k}\">\\(D^k\\times S^{n-k}\\)</span>; the dimension and attaching-map typing are explicit.</li>\n<li>It changes topology while preserving homotopy type in controlled ways.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,X',e,k,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Surgery}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surgery\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S(X,X',e,k,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(X)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land1\\leq k\\leq n\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k+1},X)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k+1},X)\\\\\n&{}\\land X'\\cong\\operatorname{cl}\\!\\left(X\\setminus e``(S^{k-1}\\times\\operatorname{int}D^{n-k+1})\\right)\\mathop{\\cup}_{e\\upharpoonright(S^{k-1}\\times S^{n-k})}(D^k\\times S^{n-k}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surgery} \\vdash \\operatorname{Surgery}_S(X,X',e,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SurgeryStructure}_S(X,X',e,k,n)","display":true},{"tex":"S^{k-1}\\times\\operatorname{int}D^{n-k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"D^k\\times S^{n-k}","display":false}],"bytes":1622,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1268","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-surgery.md|58-df-surgery]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["71fe0dc4c8613e69","36d7463d215be751","8317eefb4572709e"]}